    {
      "id": "claim_bf1b8331a92f435e952c36331604ba42",
      "statement": "Tests that use the default CacheManager share one static singleton and reset it per test: they call CacheManager.setCacheDir(tempDir, environment) in @BeforeEach (with an injected MapEnvironment and @TempDir) and the package-private CacheManager.resetDefaultInstance() in @AfterEach, which flushes the current default manager and nulls it so setCacheDir must be called again — keeping suites order-independent.",
